et only, not Jira, and must include missing reason / low confidence reason for unclear tickets."}]},"manualVerification":{"title":"Web AI prompt patch 手动体验验证","summary":"验证真实扩展里用户已经输入 prompt 后仍显示 Compose icon，并且插入的是补丁，不会自动提交给外部 AI。","prerequisites":["启动 memory-service；当前用户需要有 Jira estimate 口径相关记忆，可参考本 case 的 sampleContext.memories 写入 synthetic seed。","运行 npm start，等待 webpack compiled successfully 后刷新本地扩展。","打开 ChatGPT、Claude 或豆包等支持的 Web AI 页面，并聚焦输入框。"],"steps":["输入：帮我分析这些 Jira ticket 的 estimate，看看能不能自动生成 Dev/QA 估算。","等待输入框旁边出现 Personal AI compose icon。","hover compose icon，查看标题、来源路由和草稿回执。","点击 compose icon；如果进入复核态，点击插入。"],"expected":["标题或摘要指向“提问上下文补丁”或 Jira estimate 口径补丁。","待插入文本包含依据字段、输出列、写回边界、验证、来源处理。","待插入文本包含 Historical Story Points benchmark、missing reason / low confidence reason、不要自动写回 Jira。","回执说明这是插入外部 AI prompt 的补丁，不会提交 prompt，也不会发送给外部 AI。","输入框只增加 prompt patch，原站点不会自动发送。"],"cleanup":["停止 npm start 和 memory-service dev server。"],"evidence":["保存 report.html 或截图，包含 compose icon、hover/preview 文案和插入后的输入框。"]},"expectedTopics":["Jira","estimate","team field","Historical Story Points","Google Sheet","missing reason"],"mustNotReturnTopics":["RingCentral email login","Project Orbit"],"minExpectedTopicHits":3,"minEvidenceTopicHits":1,"expectedBehavior":{"assist":"suggest_prompt_patch","suggestionType":"prompt_patch","requiredSections":["依据字段","输出列","写回边界","验证","来源处理"],"mustInclude":["Historical Story Points benchmark","missing reason / low confidence reason","不要自动写回 Jira"],"mustNotInclude":["RingCentral email login","Project Orbit"],"riskLevel":"medium","previewRequired":true}}
